{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42239","headline":"移饶州别周使君 · 徐铉","name":"移饶州别周使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正怜东道感贤侯，何幸南冠脱楚囚。\n睆伯台前收别宴，乔公亭下舣行舟。\n四年去国身将老，百郡徵兵主尚忧。\n更向鄱阳湖上去，青衫憔悴泪交流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}